- `python3 python/cli.py deps explicit-refs --fetch-file <fixture>`
- `python3 python/cli.py deps plan --fetch-file <fixture> --proposals-file <fixture>`

Manual smoke:

- Run `/deps --repo owner/name` on a repo whose `origin` matches; cancel at approval; verify no mutations.
- Run with a deliberate `origin` mismatch; verify no REGULAR rewrites/closes are proposed.
- Run again on a disposable repo with explicit refs in issue bodies; approve; verify edges match explicit scan.
- Run with `--pair-cap 5` on a larger repo; verify partial-audit banner, blocked dependency writes by default, and optional rewrites-only approval path.

